  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.expect": "Nothing you do not choose yourself. Build, explore, learn – the valley is not going anywhere. But when you are ready, follow the signs.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.expect.choice.back": "Good to know. Something else …",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting": "At last, you are here. The signs have grown stronger … Frosthain is awakening once more. It is time for you to walk your path. Are you ready?",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting.choice.expect": "What do you expect of me?",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting.choice.goodbye": "Perhaps later. Farewell.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting.choice.ready": "I am ready.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting.choice.signs": "Tell me about the signs.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.greeting.choice.what_happened": "What happened in the valley?",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.ready_reply": "Then go to the old shrine north of the village. When the runes speak to you, come back. And, wanderer … be careful in the passes.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.signs": "Signs in stone, ice and stars. Whoever can read them will find the way to the old shrine in the north. I believe you can – otherwise you would not be here.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.signs.choice.back": "I see. One more question …",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.what_happened": "Since last winter, the old rune stones in the valley have been glowing again. The animals avoid the passes, and at night you hear bells from the sea where there are no bells.",
  "dialogue.frosthain.eldrin.awakening.what_happened.choice.back": "Strange. Something else …",
